# Design brief for a footbridge

A mind map gathers the brief on one page. The key numbers in it are worked out under the map.

```mermaid
mindmap
  root((Footbridge))
    Geometry
      Span 24 m
      Clear width 2.5 m
    Loads
      Crowd 5 kPa
      Deck 3 kPa
    Limits
      Deflection L/360
      Frequency above 3 Hz
    Site
      Creek crossing
      Crane access one side
```

## Geometry and loads
L: 24 m | span
b: 2.5 m | clear width
q: 5 kPa | crowd load
g_d: 3 kPa | deck and parapets

## Key numbers
w: (1.2 * g_d + 1.5 * q) * b -> kN/m | design line load
Mstar: w * L^2 / 8 -> kN*m | design moment
delta_lim: L / 360 -> mm | deflection limit
